Rebased from https://dwm.suckless.org/patches/status2d/dwm-status2d-6.3.diff
onto our patch stack (attachbottom, fullgaps, movestack, cycleview,
fullscreen, xcursor already applied). Only the cleanup() hunk needed
adapting: the xcursor patch already switched that loop from free(scheme[i])
to drw_scm_free(drw, scheme[i], 3), so the upstream hunk's context no
longer matched -- kept drw_scm_free here and just widened the loop bound.

Renders ^c#RRGGBB^/^b#RRGGBB^/^d^ (fg/bg/reset) colour codes embedded in
the status text, so a status script can colour individual blocks instead
of the whole bar being a single colour.
